cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ProofTrail in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ProofTrail: an explicit-state model checking and formal verification workbench"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "ProofTrail contributors"
keywords:
  - model checking
  - formal verification
  - CTL
  - counterexample
abstract: >-
  ProofTrail explores finite transition systems described in YAML or JSON,
  checks invariants, reachability, deadlock freedom and CTL properties, and
  reports independently validated counterexample traces.
